{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37377","headline":"感物二首 二 · 唐彦谦","name":"感物二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鱼目出泥沙，空村百金珍。\n豫章值拥辏，细细供蒸薪。\n论材何必多，适用即能神。\n托交何必深，寡求永相亲。\n鲍叔拙羇鲁，张生穷厄陈。\n茫然扳援际，岂意出风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37377.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37377","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}